#: ../../source/docs/git-submodules.rst:5 3f81c12b68584bc9876f7c93ff8d351a
msgid "Git Submodules"
msgstr "Git 子模块"

#: ../../source/docs/git-submodules.rst:10 397e93ead5164299abdae70b9be2749f
msgid ""
"ArduPilot is dependent upon several external code repositories which are "
"held in **submodules**.  These are forked, cloned and built along with "
"ArduPilot."
msgstr "ArduPilot 依赖多个以 **子模块** 形式管理的外部代码仓库，这些仓库与 ArduPilot 一起被 fork、克隆和构建。"

#: ../../source/docs/git-submodules.rst:12 8c606b2038374d61910dc2c56ff7e390
msgid "`ChibiOS <https://github.com/ChibiOS>`__"
msgstr "`ChibiOS <https://github.com/ChibiOS>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/git-submodules.rst:13 d3d8c77be5ca4712aea2f7b9657d57ae
msgid "`DroneCAN <https://github.com/DroneCAN>`__"
msgstr "`DroneCAN <https://github.com/DroneCAN>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/git-submodules.rst:14 a0ec0ea94d8f41c38d3a49c05aef3a48
msgid "`waf <https://github.com/waf-project/waf>`__"
msgstr "`waf <https://github.com/waf-project/waf>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/git-submodules.rst:16 7f6307cc9c1e48c5a468444850c549b0
msgid ""
"This page describes how we use `git submodules <https://git-"
"scm.com/book/en/v2/Git-Tools-Submodules>`__ in the ArduPilot build."
msgstr ""
"本页介绍我们如何在 ArduPilot 构建中使用 `git 子模块 <https://git-scm.com/book/en/v2/Git-"
"Tools-Submodules>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/git-submodules.rst:19 3ef185e90a974b76a40bba15c6abdbcb
msgid "Submodule approach"
msgstr "子模块方式"

#: ../../source/docs/git-submodules.rst:21 f053d17207eb4c1e9aee3b2d97d25081
msgid ""
"ArduPilot uses a single level of *git submodules*, with all modules stored "
"in the `modules "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/modules>`__ directory. "
"This approach was chosen as it makes for diagnosis of issues with submodules"
" simpler.  This means that if an external project (i.e. MAVLink) has "
"submodules of its own, those submodule appear directly in the `ArduPilot "
"modules directory "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/modules>`__."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 采用单层 *git 子模块* 结构，所有模块均存储在 `modules "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/modules>`__ "
"目录中。选择此方式是为了简化子模块问题的诊断。这意味着如果外部项目（如 MAVLink）本身也有子模块，这些子模块将直接出现在 `ArduPilot 的"
" modules 目录 <https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/modules>`__ "
"中。"

#: ../../source/docs/git-submodules.rst:24 80d2d79670264410a7c358002747932b
msgid ""
"ArduPilot maintains local forks of each external project's repo in order to "
"shield itself from unexpected changes."
msgstr "ArduPilot 为每个外部项目的仓库维护本地 fork，以防范意外更改。"

#: ../../source/docs/git-submodules.rst:26 2ec0dccc00da41a4bad2990e6c4c9a3b
msgid ""
"You may also note that the URLs used for the submodules use the old "
"``git://`` protocol. This was done to make it less likely we will get "
"accidental commits on the master repositories while developers are getting "
"used to *git submodules* (as the ``git://`` protocol is read-only). "
"Developers with commit access to the submodules should add a new ardupilot "
"remote with a writeable protocol as needed."
msgstr ""
"您可能会注意到子模块使用的 URL 采用旧版 ``git://`` 协议。这样做是为了在开发者熟悉 *git 子模块* "
"的过程中，降低误向主仓库提交的风险（因为 ``git://`` 协议是只读的）。拥有子模块提交权限的开发者应根据需要添加具有可写协议的新 "
"ardupilot remote。"

#: ../../source/docs/git-submodules.rst:34 e7a0c012f8e5429e80c1bb628c8abb42
msgid "Updating your local repo's submodules"
msgstr "更新本地仓库的子模块"

